    If you have a Wi-Fi printer, you might need to connect=0A              =
                                      the printer to your Mac with a USB ca=
ble to set up Wi-Fi=0A                                                    p=
rinting. After connecting the printer to your Mac,=0A                      =
                              install the Mac software that came with the p=
rinter and=0A                                                    use the pr=
inter=E2=80=99s setup assistant to connect the printer=0A                  =
                                  to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, =
you can=0A                                                    disconnect th=
e cable from your printer and Mac and the=0A                               =
                     printer should remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=
=0A                                                &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A              =
                                  &lt;strong&gt;=0A                              =
                      3. Add the printer to your list of available printers=
:=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A        =
                                        &lt;p&gt;=0A                             =
                       Choose Apple menu &gt; System Settings, then click Prin=
ters=0A                                                    &amp; Scanners in th=
e sidebar. (You may need to scroll=0A                                      =
              down.)&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                             =
   &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    4. When y=
our printer appears in the list, select your=0A                            =
                        printer, then click Add.=0A                        =
                        &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                 =
               &lt;p&gt; It may take a minute or two for your printer to appear.=
=0A                                                    If you see a message=
 prompting you to download new=0A                                          =
          software, make sure to download and install it.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A     =
                                           &lt;strong&gt;=0A                     =
                               5. If you do not see your printer listed on =
the left,=0A                                                    click the A=
dd Printer, Scanner or Fax button on the=0A                                =
                    right.=0A                                              =
  &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A    =
                                                A dialogue appears listing =
printers on your local network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                     =
